      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 International Society of Nephrology. Published by Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "An increasing body of experimental and clinical evidence suggests that p-cresol sulfate and indoxyl sulfate contribute to the high cardiovascular burden in patients with chronic kidney disease. In a post hoc analysis on the HEMO trial, Shafi et al. failed to confirm an association between total p-cresol sulfate and indoxyl sulfate and cardiovascular outcomes in dialysis patients. Analytical issues and case-mix may explain the discrepant findings."
      },
